          acceptedAnswer: {
            '@type': 'Answer',
            text: 'The strongest high-income skills without a degree in India right now are sales and business development, software development through a serious bootcamp with deployed projects, UI/UX design with a portfolio, video editing and content creation, digital marketing execution, and skilled trades like electrical or HVAC work through ITI training. Each pays differently and requires a different kind of proof, but none of them require a college degree to start earning.',
          },
        },
